abstract: "A public, metadata-sanitized 32-record historical workbook, reproducible ranking comparisons for four-fraction, first-fraction, and non-residual chemical objectives, plus November 2026 numerical and four-figure reproduction scripts. Source-to-output agreement does not validate the historical instrument calibration or field generalization. The previously published Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23019081 corresponds to an older archive, not this release."
